---
description: Calendar editing rules (days/weeks/months)
globs:
  - 01_calendar/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---
When modifying calendar files:
- Preserve the section structure (Commitments, Maintenance, Focus blocks, Scheduled tasks).
- Use 24h times HH:MM-HH:MM.
- Prefer links to routines in 01_calendar/recurring and plans in 04_areas.
- Do not dump long notes into the day file; put them in logs/records and link them.
- Day files must have YAML front matter with required fields: id, type, area, status, created, updated.
- Date format: YYYY-MM-DD for days, YYYY-Www for weeks, YYYY-MM for months.
